    "work_id": "anf-works/against-the-heresy-of-artemon",
    "canonical_ref": "LittleLab.9.s12",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For one may compare those which were formerly prepared by them with those which have been afterwards corrupted with a special object, and many discrepancies will be found.",
