    "work_id": "anf-works/against-the-heresy-of-artemon",
    "canonical_ref": "LittleLab.9.s13",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "And as to the great audacity implied in this offence, it is not likely that even they themselves can be ignorant of that.",
