    "canonical_ref": "LittleLab.9.s14",
    "language": "eng",
    "text": "For either they do not believe that the divine Scriptures were dictated by the Holy Spirit, and are thus infidels; or they think themselves wiser than the Holy Spirit, and what are they then but demoniacs?",
